[?2004hroot@8ba3e6847568:/app# cat > PERFORMANCE_OPTIMIZATIONS.md << 'EOF'
[?2004l[?2004h> # Performance Optimizations Summary
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Issues Identified and Fixed
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### 1. Bundle Size Reduction (Compare Page)
[?2004l[?2004h> **Problem**: The compare page imported entire `lodash` and `mathjs` libraries, adding hundreds of KB to the bundle.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> **Solution**: 
[?2004l[?2004h> - Replaced all lodash functions (`groupBy`, `sortBy`, `meanBy`, `sumBy`, `maxBy`, `minBy`) with native JavaScript implementations
[?2004l[?2004h> - Replaced all mathjs functions (`mean`, `std`, `median`, `quantileSeq`, `variance`) with native JavaScript implementations
[?2004l[?2004h> - Reduced bundle size significantly (compare page now ~89 KB First Load JS)
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### 2. Excessive Re-rendering (ProductList)
